request or review such policies, endorsements, or certificates shall not affect the City’s right
or CFD’s obligation hereunder.
The City has the right to reject a certificate of insurance if CFD’s insurance company is
widely regarded in the insurance industry as financially unstable. Any insurance company
providing coverage under this MOU shall have a minimum A.M. Best rating of A-
